WEBVTT

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:01.573
We can choose to control corporations

00:14:01.573 --> 00:14:05.437
instead of allowing corporations to control us.

00:14:05.437 --> 00:14:08.852
We have a possibility to make changes.

00:14:08.852 --> 00:14:12.130
Now, I started with a quote from Samuel Johnson,

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:14.859
who said that when we make choice in life,

00:14:14.859 --> 00:14:17.446
we shouldn't forget to live.

00:14:17.446 --> 00:14:19.673
Finally, you can see

00:14:19.673 --> 00:14:21.180
I did have a choice

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:22.467
to choose one of the three quotes

00:14:22.467 --> 00:14:26.491
with which I wanted to start my lecture.

00:14:26.491 --> 00:14:28.390
I did have a choice,

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:30.698
such as nations, as people,